155
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,500
And this point of view isn't about being right or wrong.

156
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:40,400
But it has to be your own thinking.

157
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:42,600
When the interviewer sees this, they'll think to themselves,

158
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,900
This designer has a real vision for their work.

159
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,320
This is incredibly important for your portfolio.

160
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,740
And a lot of the time, this is exactly what makes a portfolio stand out.

