285
00:11:51,210 --> 00:11:53,349
What problem does your design solve?

286
00:11:53,349 --> 00:11:56,689
So, you just need to find data that proves that problem was solved.

287
00:11:56,689 --> 00:11:57,909
Just put it in, and you're good to go.

